{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12107400","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12107400","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1210740001:0":{"text":"索尼娅，这帮水鬼要投降，我们接下来怎么办？","source_cn":"索尼娅，这帮水鬼要投降，我们接下来怎么办？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49ECD0F792CBEDBA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1210740002:0":{"text":"夺取枷锁号！","source_cn":"夺取枷锁号！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE099E6A45A3CD5CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210740003:0":{"text":"——嘿，我听到你们说要夺船？正好！看来我没错过什么。","source_cn":"——嘿，我听到你们说要夺船？正好！看来我没错过什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75811FA8BBA1473D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210740004:1":{"text":"辛巴达，你来了？泰西欧呢？","source_cn":"辛巴达，你来了？泰西欧呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5DDACB708A06B47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210740005:0":{"text":"绑好了，丢在船舱里，血薇帮的弟兄们看着呢。别担心，给了他点“特别招待”，死不了。","source_cn":"绑好了，丢在船舱里，血薇帮的弟兄们看着呢。别担心，给了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F92786F649F9724","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},